"""Training entrypoints for the BioEmu x0 posterior ensemble path.

Stage A is intentionally narrow: freeze the BioEmu x0 support and train only
the conformer-level chemical-shift decoder against compact UCBSHIFT sidecars.
Posterior energies stay zero-initialized and frozen, so the posterior measure
remains prior-like while the observable decoder learns ``phi_theta(X_k, s)``.
"""

